title: Samantha3A
---
// Talk target of Samantha, wherever she stands (Hotspots layer, follows the actor). The
// actions on her: telling her he's seen enough at the viewing, giving her things and
// standing still at her door on the second Thursday.
-> I've seen enough <<if in_box("R1Viewing") and is_done("R1Viewing", "knock")>>
    <<if can("R1Viewing", "flat")>>
        <<next_scene Route1ViewingEnd>>
    <<elseif not is_done("R1Viewing", "bath")>>
        {$samantha_name}: You haven't seen the bathroom. Go on, I'll wait.
    <<elseif not is_done("R1Viewing", "kitchen")>>
        {$samantha_name}: You haven't even looked at the kitchen. Go on.
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: You haven't looked out of the window. That's the best part.
    <<endif>>
-> Give her the Red Fox 2021 <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and $r1_thu2_knocked and $item_wine_fox>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    <<if $r1_thu2_bottle_seen>>
        {$samantha_name}: You found the bottle. I put it on top for you.
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: You remembered. Good.
    <<endif>>
-> Give her the tulips <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and $r1_thu2_knocked and $item_tulips>>
    <<set $item_tulips to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_tulips to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: I said what I'd want. Not what you think I'd want.
    {$samantha_name}: ...I'll put them in water.
-> Give her the chocolate <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and $r1_thu2_knocked and $item_chocolates>>
    <<set $item_chocolates to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_chocolates to true>>
    {$samantha_name}: Bribery. Noted.
-> Give her the blush socks <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and $r1_thu2_knocked and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "door") and $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "pocket">>
    <<done R1Dinner2 socks>>
    {$samantha_name}: I don't want them.
    {$samantha_name}: I want them on you. Here. Now.
    You: On your doormat?
    {$samantha_name}: On my doormat.
    // He puts them on.
    {$samantha_name}: Better. Next time they're on before you knock.
-> Stand still <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and is_done("R1Dinner2", "dinner") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "wait")>>
    <<next_scene Route1Thu2Kiss>>
-> Reach for her <<if can("R1Dinner2", "reach")>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_kiss to "reached">>
    <<done R1Dinner2 reach>>
    // She catches his wrist and puts his hand back by his side.
    {$samantha_name}: Hands.
    {$samantha_name}: I said don't move.
-> Talk
    <<if in_box("R1Viewing")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Take your time. I've got all day. Well, until the next one.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner1") and not is_done("R1Dinner1", "dinner")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Five minutes. Stop hovering and sit.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner1") and not is_done("R1Dinner1", "dishes")>>
        {$samantha_name}: I'm not moving. You are. Sink.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "door")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Hands first. Then shoes.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "open")>>
        {$samantha_name}: The wine won't open itself.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "dinner")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Sit. I'm not serving you standing up.
    <<elseif in_box("R1Dinner2") and not is_done("R1Dinner2", "wait")>>
        {$samantha_name}: Don't move.
    <<else>>
        {$samantha_name}: Mm?
    <<endif>>
===
